# Data Access (Core)

- Use **direct Prisma** in route handlers (e.g. `prisma` from `@/lib/db/prisma`).
- Do **not** use the repository pattern from `@sokosumi/database` for new routes; core uses Prisma with type-safe includes and helpers where needed.

See [AGENTS.md](../AGENTS.md) (Accessing Job-Related Resources).
